# Seuls mes consignes, mes réglages et mes skills maison sont versionnés.
# Tout le reste reste local : sessions, historique, caches, plans, mémoire des projets,
# skills synchronisées depuis claude.ai, skills externes (voir THIRD_PARTY.md).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/settings.json
!/THIRD_PARTY.md
!/scripts/
!/hooks/
!/cloud/
!/skills/
# Every skill of mine is versioned by default; only these stay out: the ones synced from
# claude.ai and the third-party ones (THIRD_PARTY.md, reinstalled by scripts/).
/skills/synced/
/skills/anatomy/
/skills/transitions-dev/
/skills/transitions-polish/
/skills/transitions-ui-generation/

# Logs and locks of the hooks
/hooks/*.log
/hooks/.push-setup.lock/
/skills/.trash/
